# Development-only values for `wrangler dev` / local `npm run dev`.
# Copy this example to gitignored .dev.vars. NEVER commit real values here.
#
# Preview and production values live in Cloudflare Secrets and are referenced
# through env.NAME. Configure Session signing values in GitHub Secrets for the
# reviewed deploy workflow; see docs/serving-and-security.md. The bundle check
# (`npm run check:secrets`) fails if any value below leaks into build/client.
#
# Example:
# HEALTHZ_TOKEN=local-development-only-token
# SESSION_COOKIE_SECRET=replace-with-a-32-character-minimum-local-secret
# ABUSE_HMAC_SECRET=replace-with-a-different-32-character-random-secret
#
# Optional public donation addresses for the anonymous /support page. These are
# public page content, never secrets; leave one out to hide that asset. Preview
# and production set them in wrangler.jsonc instead.
# SUPPORT_MONERO_ADDRESS=
# SUPPORT_BITCOIN_ADDRESS=
# SUPPORT_LIGHTNING_ADDRESS=
# SUPPORT_ETHEREUM_ADDRESS=
